#* ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#* BUILD CONTEXT EXCLUSIONS — EVERYTHING HERE IS EITHER REBUILT INSIDE THE
#* IMAGE, MOUNTED AS A VOLUME AT RUNTIME, OR A SECRET THAT MUST NEVER BE
#* BAKED INTO A LAYER.
#* ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

#* HOST-BUILT ARTEFACTS — node_modules IS LINUX-INCOMPATIBLE (bcrypt IS A
#* NATIVE ADDON COMPILED FOR WINDOWS), AND dist IS REBUILT BY THE BUILDER STAGE
node_modules
dist
build
coverage
.nyc_output
*.tsbuildinfo

#* VCS / TOOLING
.git
.gitignore
.github
.vscode
.idea
.prettierrc
eslint.config.mjs

#* SECRETS — NOTE THIS ALSO MAKES @nestjs/config FIND NO .env FILE INSIDE THE
#* CONTAINER, SO CONFIGURATION COMES *ONLY* FROM REAL ENVIRONMENT VARIABLES
#* INJECTED BY COMPOSE. THAT IS DELIBERATE: ONE SOURCE OF TRUTH, NO SHADOWING.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

#* RUNTIME STATE — BOTH ARE BACKED BY NAMED VOLUMES (SEE docker-compose.yml).
#* uploads/ IS ~53 MB OF PRODUCT IMAGERY; SHIPPING IT IN THE IMAGE WOULD MAKE
#* EVERY REBUILD RE-PUSH IT. SEE DOCKER.md FOR SEEDING THE VOLUME INSTEAD.
uploads
logs
custom-logs

#* DOCS / TESTS — NOT NEEDED TO RUN THE SERVICE
docs
documentations
claude-doc
test
README.md
Dockerfile
.dockerignore
